<title>USA: Plantronics CFO Daniel Gaudreau resigns.</title>
<headline>Plantronics CFO Daniel Gaudreau resigns.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CRUZ, Calif 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Plantronics Inc said Friday that its chief financial officer, Daniel Gaudreau, has resigned to become the chief financial officer of a privately held software company at the end of this month.</p>
<p>The company, which designs and makes headset communications products, said it hopes to fill the position in the near future.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
